<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen Dec 27.</title>
<headline>Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen Dec 27.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch stock market is closed for the Christmas holiday on December 26 and will reopen on Friday, December 27.</p>
<p>Shares closed Tuesday's half-day trading session marginally lower ahead of the holiday, with the AEX index of leading shares down 1.08 points to 633.95.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000, fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
